                [ 'h3', 'xTool F1 Ultra: 20 W fibre for numbers and depth' ],
                [ 'p', 'The F1 Ultra pairs a 20 W fibre laser with a diode laser. xTool lists deep engraving, embossing and thin metal cutting, quotes speeds of up to 10,000 mm/s on almost all metals and describes batch work with a conveyor. It is the lower-cost route to numbers, nameplates and codes on metal when you don’t need the 60 W of the F2 Ultra.' ],
